Q6. fixed-13 relationship
  ACCEPT the claim that order-10b does not replace fixed-13, but CHALLENGE the
  premise that fixed-13 remains unfinished. The independent binder/type/quantifier
  audit was completed and recorded at
  logs/gates/checker-strengthening/exact-13-type-audit-20260817.log.
  Result: retain 8; reject current exact binding for 5. Immediate safe downgrades
  are certification.critical_bound, invariance.update_bisimulation, and
  temporaldc.observed_termination. Two exact-preserving rebinds require user
  decisions. Stage 2 must not overwrite or silently postpone these findings.

